Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Uma coisa que me deixa
Dialogue: 2,0:00:01.70,0:00:02.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}muito preocupada
Dialogue: 2,0:00:02.90,0:00:04.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}é que algumas formulações
Dialogue: 2,0:00:08.70,0:00:10.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}da dose recomendada
Dialogue: 2,0:00:10.44,0:00:12.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}de vitaminas do complexo B
Dialogue: 2,0:00:12.36,0:00:13.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}por latinha.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:13.84,0:00:15.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}A presença de cafeína
Dialogue: 2,0:00:15.06,0:00:16.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}nos energéticos
Dialogue: 2,0:00:16.30,0:00:18.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}tem sido uma das causas
Dialogue: 2,0:00:18.12,0:00:19.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}de lesão renal.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:19.32,0:00:20.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}E alguns energéticos têm
Dialogue: 2,0:00:20.94,0:00:22.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}uma quantidade muito alta
Dialogue: 2,0:00:22.18,0:00:23.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}de cafeína,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:23.16,0:00:26.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}até 300 mg de cafeína
Dialogue: 2,0:00:26.26,0:00:27.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}por dose.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:30.58,0:00:31.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}E tem um outro
Dialogue: 2,0:00:31.56,0:00:33.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}que é um nome muito estranho
Dialogue: 2,0:00:33.08,0:00:33.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}que eu vou ter que ler
Dialogue: 2,0:00:33.72,0:00:35.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}pra vocês, chamado
Dialogue: 2,0:00:35.08,0:00:37.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}glucuronolactona,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:38.00,0:00:39.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}que é um metabólito
Dialogue: 2,0:00:39.32,0:00:40.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}do carboidrato
Dialogue: 2,0:00:40.42,0:00:41.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}excretado pelo rim.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:41.76,0:00:43.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Ele, em altas doses,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:43.06,0:00:44.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}pode aumentar
Dialogue: 2,0:00:44.54,0:00:46.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}a carga osmótica do rim,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:46.14,0:00:48.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}e pode ser uma causa
Dialogue: 2,0:00:48.12,0:00:50.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}de uma lesão renal aguda.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:50.24,0:00:52.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Por isso, é interessante
Dialogue: 2,0:00:52.42,0:00:54.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}que você preste atenção
Dialogue: 2,0:00:54.56,0:00:56.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}na quantidade de energético
Dialogue: 2,0:00:56.26,0:00:57.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}que você toma por dia,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:00.08,0:01:01.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}de uma forma tão clara
Dialogue: 2,0:01:01.76,0:01:03.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}todo esse excesso.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:03.70,0:01:04.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}O que eu estou
Dialogue: 2,0:01:04.22,0:01:05.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}dizendo aqui
Dialogue: 2,0:01:05.30,0:01:05.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}não é que você
Dialogue: 2,0:01:05.94,0:01:06.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}não pode tomar,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:07.08,0:01:07.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}mas que você
Dialogue: 2,0:01:07.78,0:01:09.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}não tome em excesso.
